  "ingredients": [
    "4 ounce broccoli",
    "4 ounce mozzarella cheese",
    "3/4 cup almond flour",
    "7 tablespoon flaxseed meal",
    "2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "2 large egg",
    "1/4 cup mayonnaise",
    "1/4 cup fresh dill (chopped)",
    "1/2 tablespoon lemon juice",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Add broccoli to a food processor and pulse until the broccoli is broken down into small pieces. You want it to be well processed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-broccoli-cheese-fritters/#wprm-recipe-51575-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_49341.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together the cheese, almond flour, flaxseed meal and baking powder with the broccoli. If you want to add any extra seasonings (salt and pepper), do it at this point.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-broccoli-cheese-fritters/#wprm-recipe-51575-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_4942.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the eggs and mix together well until everything is incorporated.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-broccoli-cheese-fritters/#wprm-recipe-51575-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_4948.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll the batter into balls and then coat with flaxseed meal.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-broccoli-cheese-fritters/#wprm-recipe-51575-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_4952.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue doing this with all of the batter and set aside on paper towels.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-broccoli-cheese-fritters/#wprm-recipe-51575-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_4955.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat your deep fat fryer to 375F. Once ready, lay broccoli and cheese fritters inside the basket, not overcrowding it.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-broccoli-cheese-fritters/#wprm-recipe-51575-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_4960.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry the fritters until golden brown, about 3-5 minutes. Once done, lay on paper towels to drain excess grease and season to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-broccoli-cheese-fritters/#wprm-recipe-51575-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_4970.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Feel free to make a zesty dill and lemon mayonnaise for a dip. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-broccoli-cheese-fritters/#wprm-recipe-51575-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
